  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">START Alert 1009 -  Response to diphtheria in Mauritania</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening WASH systems in diphtheria isolation and treatment centres in Bassiknou and Mberra camp- Strengthening water storage reserves and monitoring water quality- Installation of emergency latrines with handwashing facilities, provision of 100-litre wheeled bins,- Distribution of mini sanitation kits consisting of traditional brooms, rakes, shovels, wheelbarrows, brushes, bin bags and pairs of gloves.</narrative>
